# CHANGELOG.md is now ASSEMBLED from changelog.d/, not hand-edited — see
# changelog.d/README.md. Add entries as new files there.
#
# The union driver below is retained for the release-assembly commit and for
# any straggler branch that still edits CHANGELOG.md directly. Do NOT rely on
# it to keep a PR mergeable: `merge=union` is honored by local git (a
# `git merge-tree` against main resolves clean) but is NOT honored by GitHub's
# server-side merge. Measured 2026-08-06 — merge-tree said CLEAN while the API
# reported mergeable=CONFLICTING/DIRTY on the same four PRs. A mitigation that
# passes on every machine where it is verified and fails in the only place that
# decides is worse than none: it reads as "already fixed".
CHANGELOG.md merge=union
